# Subject access request under Article 15 UK GDPR

Dear Data Protection Officer,

I am a student at {{ institution }}{% if student.programme %}, enrolled in {{ student.programme }}{% endif %}{% if student.student_id %} (student number {{ student.student_id }}){% endif %}. Under Article 15 of the UK GDPR, I am making a subject access request for the personal data concerning me that the university, or any processor acting on its behalf, has processed in connection with the checking of my work{% if request.submission_title %} "{{ request.submission_title }}"{% endif %}{% if request.course %} for {{ request.course }}{% endif %}{% if submission_date %}, submitted on {{ submission_date }}{% endif %}{% if tools %}, including any checks made with {{ tools | join(", ") }}{% endif %}.

To help you search for it, I am asking specifically for:

1. A copy of every similarity report and every AI-writing report generated for this work, in the full version available to staff, including the matched sources, the matched passages and the settings applied (for example, whether quotations, the bibliography or small matches were excluded).
2. Any notes, assessments, emails or decisions concerning me that rely on those reports, and a record of who reviewed them.
3. Whether my work has been stored in the provider's repository of submitted papers, and for how long it will be kept.
4. The purposes of the processing and its recipients, including the provider of each tool and the countries where it processes the data, with the safeguards for any transfer outside the UK.
5. Whether any significant decision about me has been based solely on automated processing and, if so, meaningful information about the logic involved and its significance and envisaged consequences (Article 15(1)(h)).
{% for item in request.extra_items %}
{{ loop.index + 5 }}. {{ item }}
{% endfor %}

Please send the information electronically. I expect a reply without undue delay and in any event within {{ duration(deadline) }} of receipt (Article 12A), free of charge (Article 12(5)). If you need any information from me to locate the data, please ask promptly.

Yours sincerely,

{{ student.name }}
